evance procedures"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Which subject lies outside JCM's purview?","options":{"A":"Leave procedures","B":"Staff canteens","C":"Pension rules","D":"Duty hours"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Railway employees are covered by JCM through the:","options":{"A":"National Council directly","B":"Departmental Council for Railways","C":"Office Council only","D":"They are excluded"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"On railways, JCM:","options":{"A":"Handles train operations","B":"Replaces PNM","C":"Complements PNM as a consultative forum","D":"Abolishes unions"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"The staff side of a JCM council is coordinated by:","options":{"A":"The staff side secretary","B":"The CAG","C":"The PMO","D":"The Cabinet Secretary"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"JCM discussion items are:","options":{"A":"Sent to courts","B":"Published in press","C":"Raised on the spot","D":"Submitted as agenda in advance"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"JCM also concerns itself with:","options":{"A":"Only discipline","B":"Only transfers","C":"Only welfare","D":"Efficiency and welfare of administration"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"The JCM scheme covers:","options":{"A":"Only armed forces","B":"Only judiciary","C":"Only railways","D":"Central Government civilian employees"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"The underlying principle of JCM is:","options":{"A":"Centralisation","B":"Outsourcing","C":"Secrecy","D":"Association of staff with management decisions"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"The National Council deals with matters affecting:","options":{"A":"Central Government employees generally","B":"One state","C":"One office","D":"One department"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Reference to JCM arbitration is limited to:","options":{"A":"Matters within JCM scope","B":"Pay commission awards","C":"Election disputes","D":"Any demand"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Compulsory arbitration under JCM covers:","options":{"A":"Criminal cases","B":"Property disputes","C":"All service matters","D":"Defined arbitrable matters within scope"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Historically, JCM represents:","options":{"A":"A post-independence staff consultation innovation","B":"A private enterprise","C":"A court of law","D":"A colonial relic"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The working method of JCM is:","options":{"A":"Strikes","B":"Lockouts","C":"Unilateral orders","D":"Structured dialogue"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Decisions recorded in JCM minutes are:","options":{"A":"Acted upon by government","B":"Filed away","C":"Burnt","D":"Ignored"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"JCM and PNM are:","options":{"A":"Complementary forums","B":"Identical bodies","C":"Defunct bodies","D":"Rivals"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"JCM seeks to promote:","options":{"A":"Suspicion","B":"Apathy","C":"Confrontation","D":"Willing cooperation and harmony"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"In JCM, the staff side functions through:","options":{"A":"Anonymous letters","B":"Fragmented demands","C":"United staff representation","D":"Individual petitions"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"The official side in JCM comprises:","options":{"A":"Senior government officers","B":"Retired staff","C":"Journalists","D":"Union leaders"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The key difference between JCM and PNM is:","options":{"A":"They are identical","B":"JCM consults while PNM negotiates","C":"JCM negotiates while PNM consults","D":"Both are courts"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"A valid JCM agenda item is:","options":{"A":"Monetary policy","B":"Election schedule","C":"Defence policy","D":"Staff welfare measures"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Today, JCM is:","options":{"A":"A sports body","B":"A bank","C":"Abolished","D":"An active consultation channel"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Departmental Councils exist to:","options":{"A":"Run elections","B":"Bypass staff","C":"Address departmental staff matters","D":"Fix taxes"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Office Councils under JCM handle:","options":{"A":"Foreign affairs","B":"Defence","C":"National policy","D":"Office-level staff matters"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"JCM strikes a balance between:","options":{"A":"Participation with government authority retained","B":"No staff role","C":"Judicial review","D":"Staff veto power"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The arbitration clause in the JCM scheme:","options":{"A":"Privatises it","B":"Weakens it","C":"Strengthens it","D":"Abolishes it"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"The core purpose of JCM is:","options":{"A":"Franchising","B":"Profit sharing","C":"Joint consultation on service matters","D":"Shareholding"},"answer":"C"}]